`AGENTS.md` is canonical. Read it before implementation, then identify the active task in `docs/TASKS/` and the contracts it cites.

For frontend work, also read `docs/CONTRACTS/ui-workbench.md` and `docs/CONTRACTS/visual-assets.md`. The phase-1 UI is a preview-only conversational artifact workbench: production console beside a persistent artifact preview panel, with explicit artifact type selection and professional code/PDF previews.

For task 018, treat old frontend appearance, layout, component hierarchy, and visual assets as disposable. Preserve backend-facing behavior and do not change backend code or contracts for appearance work.

Keep changes bounded to the active task. If implementation needs to cross task scope or change a contract, update the governance asset first or ask the human.
